    "https://www.sdsmt.edu/student-life/support-and-services/career-services/internships-and-co-ops.html": {
      "title": "Internships and Co-ops",
      "description": "Gain Real Experience: Internships and Co-ops Offered Skip to content I am a Current Student Admitted Student Faculty/Staff Parent/Family Alumni Industry Partner Events News Ways to Give toggle menu Apply Now Visit Us Request Info Academics Expand Submenu Explore All Programs Academic Departments Courses & Registration Education Abroad Internships & Co-ops Co-curricular Programs Online Programs Academic Support Devereaux Library Museum of Geology Admissions & Aid Expand Submenu Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions International Students Tuition & Fees Financial Aid & Scholarships Visit Mines Contact Admissions Student Life Expand Submenu Living On Campus Opportunity Center Health & Safety Support & Services Campus Points of Interest Get Involved Research & Innovation Expand Submenu Research Research Facilities Innovation & Entrepreneurship Industry Engagement Athletics Expand Submenu About Expand Submenu Accreditation State Authorization Mission, Vision, & Values Strategic Plan Campus Points of Interest History & Traditions Points of Pride University Leadership Offices & Administration Safety & Security Faculty & Staff Directory Policies & Compliance I am a Current Student Admitted Student Faculty/Staff Parent/Family Alumni Industry Partner Events News Ways to Give toggle search search submit Expand actions Apply Now Visit Us Request Info Internships and Co-ops Home student-life support-and-services career-services Internships and Co-ops At South Dakota Mines, learning goes beyond the classroom. Hands-on experience is\n               the hallmark of a Hardrocker education, and our internship and co-op program connects\n               students with leading employers across the nation. In the 2024-2025 academic year, 75% of graduates reported having a paid, real-world experience during their time at Mines.\n                  These opportunities help students build skills, expand networks, and often lead directly\n                  to full-time job offers. Through internships, co-ops, and research, Mines students apply classroom knowledge\n                  to real challenges at companies like Garmin, Google, Caterpillar, and Nucor — gaining\n                  the expertise and confidence that make them among the most sought-after graduates\n                  in the country. Career Services at South Dakota Mines advocates for all students to receive paid internship\n                     and co-op opportunities in alignment with NACE's position statement on unpaid internships . Internship Search - Online Resources: Handshake Idealist Glassdoor YouTern Chegg Internships HER Campus SimplyHired Internships USA LinkedIn Indeed.com Global Experiences NASA Pathways Program CollegeGrad Internships HACU Nat'l Internship Program Internship Programs USA Jobs Internships Intern Jobs Way Up Internships Co-op Documents Academic Credit Job Offer Form Evaluation Student Report Format back to top 501 E. Saint Joseph St. Rapid City, SD 57701 (605) 394-2511 admissions@sdsmt.edu Consumer Information Directory Careers at Mines Campus Map Sustainability © South Dakota Mines Site design by iFactory ©"
    },
