    "https://www.sdsmt.edu/about/offices-and-administration/human-resources/careers-at-mines.html": {
      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers at Mines Skip to content I am a Current Student Admitted Student Faculty/Staff Parent/Family Alumni Industry Partner Events News Ways to Give toggle menu Apply Now Visit Us Request Info Academics Expand Submenu Explore All Programs Academic Departments Courses & Registration Education Abroad Internships & Co-ops Co-curricular Programs Online Programs Academic Support Devereaux Library Museum of Geology Admissions & Aid Expand Submenu Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions International Students Tuition & Fees Financial Aid & Scholarships Visit Mines Contact Admissions Student Life Expand Submenu Living On Campus Opportunity Center Health & Safety Support & Services Campus Points of Interest Get Involved Research & Innovation Expand Submenu Research Research Facilities Innovation & Entrepreneurship Industry Engagement Athletics Expand Submenu About Expand Submenu Accreditation State Authorization Mission, Vision, & Values Strategic Plan Campus Points of Interest History & Traditions Points of Pride University Leadership Offices & Administration Safety & Security Faculty & Staff Directory Policies & Compliance I am a Current Student Admitted Student Faculty/Staff Parent/Family Alumni Industry Partner Events News Ways to Give toggle search search submit Expand actions Apply Now Visit Us Request Info Careers at South Dakota Mines Section Menu Home about offices-and-administration human-resources Careers at Mines Section Menu Close navigation menu offices-and-administration Careers at Mines Benefits Careers at Mines Join more than 425 faculty and staff whose impact is felt on campus, in the community,\n                     and the world beyond. In this rich environment of innovation and education, you'll\n                     experience growth and effect change. Explore our job opportunities and discover a\n                     breadth of exciting careers. Employment Opportunities Faculty & Staff South Dakota Mines in conjunction with the South Dakota Board of Regents utilizes\n               an online shared employment system for all of our employee recruitment efforts. This\n               system allows applicants to search vacancies, complete online applications, and attach\n               application materials. Click the button below, then choose “South Dakota Mines” from\n               the search list. Search Employment Opportunities For more information on benefits, visit the following page: Benefits Non-State Positions at South Dakota Mines Including Sodexo (dining services), South Dakota Mines Center for Alumni Relations\n               and Advancement (CARA) Employment Opportunities for Students Student Employment : Work-Study and Non-Work-Study opportunities. Resources For Employers You can connect with our exceptional engineering and science students through our\n                     Career Services Office. Visit South Dakota Mines Career Services online resources to find out more about recruiting on campus, career fairs, and more. Email: careerservices@sdsmt.edu Phone: (605) 394-2667 back to top 501 E. Saint Joseph St. Rapid City, SD 57701 (605) 394-2511 admissions@sdsmt.edu Consumer Information Directory Careers at Mines Campus Map Sustainability © South Dakota Mines Site design by iFactory ©"
    },
    "https://www.sdsmt.edu/student-life/support-and-services/career-services/index.html": {
      "title": "Career Services",
      "description": "Career Services Skip to content I am a Current Student Admitted Student Faculty/Staff Parent/Family Alumni Industry Partner Events News Ways to Give toggle menu Apply Now Visit Us Request Info Academics Expand Submenu Explore All Programs Academic Departments Courses & Registration Education Abroad Internships & Co-ops Co-curricular Programs Online Programs Academic Support Devereaux Library Museum of Geology Admissions & Aid Expand Submenu Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions International Students Tuition & Fees Financial Aid & Scholarships Visit Mines Contact Admissions Student Life Expand Submenu Living On Campus Opportunity Center Health & Safety Support & Services Campus Points of Interest Get Involved Research & Innovation Expand Submenu Research Research Facilities Innovation & Entrepreneurship Industry Engagement Athletics Expand Submenu About Expand Submenu Accreditation State Authorization Mission, Vision, & Values Strategic Plan Campus Points of Interest History & Traditions Points of Pride University Leadership Offices & Administration Safety & Security Faculty & Staff Directory Policies & Compliance I am a Current Student Admitted Student Faculty/Staff Parent/Family Alumni Industry Partner Events News Ways to Give toggle search search submit Expand actions Apply Now Visit Us Request Info Career Services Section Menu Home student-life support-and-services career-services Section Menu Close navigation menu support-and-services Career Services Career Fair Data Internships and Co-ops Career Services partners with students, employers, alumni, and the community to prepare South Dakota\n               Mines graduates for successful, rewarding careers . Our graduates are in high demand for their strong academics and professional readiness.\n               Placement rates reflect graduates employed in their field, pursuing advanced degrees,\n               serving in the military, or not seeking employment. Placement 94% of our 2025 graduates landed jobs at 192 unique employers across 36 states. 97% Placement for AY25 BS grads with internship experience 82% Placement for AY25 BS grads without internship experience $76,805 Average Starting Salary Related Links Career Fair Career Guide Data Internships and Co-ops About Us There’s a reason our students are in high demand. Through our expansive internship\n                                 program, one-on-one interview prep and resume review, and year-round workshops and\n                                 events, we won’t just help you hit the ground running. We’ll give you a competitive\n                                 edge. Whether you are a student, alumnus, or employer, we want to connect you to the people\n                                 and places you need to succeed. Email us to make an appointment today. Rebecca Monahan Career Services Director Devereaux Library, 214 rebecca.monahan@sdsmt.edu Madi Fuegen Сareer Services Coordinator Devereaux Library, 209 madison.fuegen@sdsmt.edu Contact Career Services Located in the Devereaux Library (Main Floor - Offices 209 & 214) Hours: 7:30 AM - 4:30 PM, Mon. - Fri. Summer Hours: 7:30 AM - 4:00 PM (605) 394-2667 careerservices@sdsmt.edu back to top 501 E. Saint Joseph St. Rapid City, SD 57701 (605) 394-2511 admissions@sdsmt.edu Consumer Information Directory Careers at Mines Campus Map Sustainability © South Dakota Mines Site design by iFactory ©"
    },
